    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST NOW &amp; JOIN THE ACTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An 80s Cartoon Hero. A Toy-Sized Mission. A Cinematic Platforming Rush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BECOME THE TOY THAT SAVES THE DAY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Dutch Maximus, a washed-up 80s action star turned 6-inch plastic legend, in a fast-paced FPS platformer bursting with parkour, grappling hooks, and all-out chaos.  to outsmart your arch-nemesis, rescue your squad, and prove even mini heroes can pack a big punch! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced Parkour Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple worlds, each with their own unique visual and gameplay style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the toy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focus on mastery, strive to improve your time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully animated cinematic story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140520/extras/Wall_run_dyna.GIF?t=1746732135\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly trained, use Dutch's signature parkour skills to slide run and jump over the bad guys out maneuvering them at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grapple Hook</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140520/extras/Grapple.GIF?t=1746732135\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Dutch's trusty Slapling hook to pull yourself closer to enemies and out of sticky sitations bringing you closer to the action than ever before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slime Gun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140520/extras/Shoot.GIF?t=1746732135\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime enemies and stop them in their tracks gaining a bonus to your time and bringing you closer to beating the level and improving your time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully articulate and 6 inches tall you are the toy, you play through a vast array of unique toy sets as you strive to rescue your team of toy friends from the clutches of your old nemesis</p>",
