raph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slime Gun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140520/extras/Shoot.GIF?t=1746732135\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime enemies and stop them in their tracks gaining a bonus to your time and bringing you closer to beating the level and improving your time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully articulate and 6 inches tall you are the toy, you play through a vast array of unique toy sets as you strive to rescue your team of toy friends from the clutches of your old nemesis</p>",
